import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How we choose — Trove & Tier" description="How Trove & Tier researches, evaluates and presents home product recommendations."><Header/><main class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Our editorial standards</p><h1>Worth the<br/><em>space?</em></h1><p class="lead">We believe a useful recommendation should explain more than why something looks good.</p><section><h2>What we look for</h2><ul><li><strong>Purpose:</strong> What everyday problem is this item meant to solve?</li><li><strong>Fit:</strong> Are dimensions, clearances and compatibility details available?</li><li><strong>Materials:</strong> What is it made from, and what care does it require?</li><li><strong>Trade-offs:</strong> What limitations should a reader consider?</li><li><strong>Alternatives:</strong> Are there other approaches or options worth considering?</li></ul><h2>How we describe evidence</h2><p>Manufacturer specifications, independent research, editorial assessment and hands-on testing are different things. We will identify the basis for a claim and will never imply that we personally tested an item when we did not.</p><h2>Prices and availability</h2><p>Retail prices and stock change. Where displayed, market, retailer and verification date should be clear. If a current price or availability cannot be confirmed, readers should check directly with the retailer.</p><h2>Commercial relationships</h2><p>Some links may earn us a commission. Affiliate relationships do not guarantee inclusion or a positive recommendation. Sponsored and gifted content will be clearly identified.</p><h2>Corrections</h2><p>If we discover an error, we will correct the information and make material changes clear to readers.</p></section></main><footer><a href="/">TROVE &amp; TIER</a><span>THOUGHTFUL FINDS. BETTER LIVING.</span></footer></BaseLayout>
<style>.wrap{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:80px 5% 110px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--color-deep-sage);text-transform:uppercase}h1{font:clamp(65px,9vw,110px)/.9 var(--font-display);margin:25px 0}h1 em{color:var(--color-deep-sage);font-weight:400}.lead{font:26px/1.45 var(--font-display);max-width:650px;margin:35px 0 65px}section{max-width:700px;margin-left:auto}h2{font:36px var(--font-display);margin:38px 0 10px}section p,li{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#5f6158}li{padding:5px 0}footer{background:var(--color-charcoal);color:var(--color-ivory);padding:25px 5%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.15em}footer a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}</style>
